  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p><strong>• About our brand and products:</strong><br>Key-Trade designs professional trading keyboards for traders who want faster, cleaner, and more precise execution. Its products include the <strong>Trading Pad PRO</strong> and <strong>Trading Pad MINI</strong>, physical devices with programmed buttons for actions such as buy, sell, close, cancel orders, move SL to breakeven, modify SL/TP, partial close, reverse positions, zoom, and timeframe changes.</p><p><strong>• What makes us different:</strong><br>Key-Trade is built around physical precision, speed, and risk control. The devices are Plug &amp; Play, compatible with TradingView, MetaTrader 4/5, cTrader, NinjaTrader, and Sierra Chart, and designed to reduce clicks, execution errors, and reaction time during live trading.</p><p><strong>• How affiliates can earn:</strong><br>Affiliates can earn by promoting Key-Trade products and referring clients who purchase a Trading Pad through their affiliate link or code. The product is especially attractive for active traders, scalpers, prop firm traders, and anyone looking to improve execution speed and trade management. Separate affiliate promotions may include pay per post and pay per review.</p><p><strong>• How to promote us:</strong><br>Affiliates can promote Key-Trade through trading content, platform tutorials, product demonstrations, reviews, execution-speed comparisons, prop firm communities, YouTube, Instagram, TikTok, Discord, Telegram, newsletters, and trading education channels.</p><p><strong>• Other information:</strong><br>Key-Trade offers worldwide shipping, including Europe, Latin America, USA, and India. Orders typically arrive within 5 to 10 business days depending on location. The devices work with both live accounts and prop firm accounts and do not require programming knowledge.</p><p><em><strong>IMPORTANT: 5% Discount for clients will be automatically manually set.</strong></em></p></div><